        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Setup:</strong> $2,500</li>
          <li><strong>Monthly:</strong> $497 flat, managed service</li>
          <li><strong>Included:</strong> 24/7 answering in your business's voice, storm-damage and active-leak triage by your rules, dispatch to the on-call crew you named, estimate and inspection booking on the calendar you already use (ServiceTitan, Housecall Pro, or Jobber when that is the calendar), SMS follow-up, call recordings and transcripts, a monthly tuning session</li>
          <li><strong>Not charged:</strong> no per-minute charges and no per-call charges. The Front Door website fee ($497) credits toward this build if started within 60 days.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          An industry estimate from national vendor data puts a recovered
